    "article": "\"American League All-Stars Dominate in Shutout Victory, 4-0\"\n\nThe American League All-Stars made a statement in the midsummer classic, blanking the National League All-Stars 4-0 behind a strong team effort on the mound. Miguel Vargas was the standout hitter, going 1-for-2 with a home run that sailed over the left field wall. On the pitching side, Justin Wrobleski was electric in relief, striking out five in two innings while only allowing one earned run. Dylan Cease earned the win, as the AL staff combined to shut down the NL lineup.",
